<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel Corp 1996 net profit down 4.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Keppel Corp 1996 net profit down 4.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			204.10  vs    214.09</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)		13.0   vs     13.0</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	    39.1   vs     42.20</p>
<p>    Turnover (bln)		   2.89   vs	2.40</p>
<p>    Investment income		7.71   vs     10.97</p>
<p>    Other income&amp;interest	 61.91   vs     41.06</p>
<p>    Interest expense		64.16   vs     41.82</p>
<p>    Operating pretax	     487.37   vs    428.84</p>
<p>    Associates			19.03   vs     16.06</p>
<p>    Tax				107.50   vs     84.06</p>
<p>    Minorities		    (194.81)  vs   (146.75)</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Keppel Corporation Ltd.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
